{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50030","headline":"句 · 曹戵","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花映昼天当户日，树摇晴暮上阶烟。\n惊飞沙鸟纷纷雪，候信云帆片片风。\n凤唱一抛琴瑟韵，霓裳长谢绮罗春。\n秋澄上水无藏影，春泛游云不系心。\n老松不见千年鹤，残雪犹疑六月花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹戵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}